The class also supports adding custom headers to requests and provides options for retrying failed requests with exponential backoff. Additionally, it integrates with an environment variable manager to securely store API credentials and automatically load them at runtime. Finally, it includes a feature that allows the function to validate the SSL certificate when making HTTPS requests based on user preference.

